    "since": "2026-09-19"
   },
   {
    "title": "Four products are sold from one site",
    "scope": "site",
    "scope_kind": "site",
    "scope_value": "",
    "status": "active",
    "fact": "The site sells web development, an SEO retainer, a dealership website builder,\nand dealer licensing support, with an automation offer alongside. Each has its\nown landing page, and licensing and SEO each have their own checkout and\ncustomer portal.",
    "guidance": "these are separate demand pools that happen to share a domain. A\nsite-level figure at this volume is the sum of four near-empty ones and says\nnothing about any of them. Report by page, and say when a page has too little\ndata to read.",
    "since": "2026-09-19",
    "extra": {
     "source": "repository"
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "The portfolio pages carry clients' own brands",
    "scope": "page /portfolio",
    "scope_kind": "page",
    "scope_value": "/portfolio",
    "status": "active",
    "fact": "`/portfolio/scooter-shop` and `/portfolio/bloomprint` describe work done for\nScootershop and Bloomprint, both of which are separate properties in this same\nreporting series.",
    "guidance": "impressions these pages earn for a client's brand terms are a fact about\nFreeTheDesk's own index footprint, not demand for FreeTheDesk. Never count them\nas an opportunity, and flag them if they start competing with the client's own\nsite on the client's own name.",
    "since": "2026-09-19",
    "extra": {
     "source": "repository"
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "Web development is sold in Perth; the dealer product is not",
    "scope": "site",
    "scope_kind": "site",
    "scope_value": "",
    "status": "active",
    "fact": "Web development and SEO are sold to local Perth businesses. The dealership\nwebsite builder and licensing support are aimed at vehicle dealers and are not\ngeographically limited to Perth in the way a services engagement is.",
    "guidance": "judge `/website-development-perth` and `/seo` against Perth-qualified\ndemand as a matter of commercial judgement, not by any measure derived from\nwhether a query happened to contain the word Perth. Search Console has no\ngeography finer than the country; where that limit bites, state it.",
    "since": "2026-09-19",
    "extra": {
     "source": "repository"
    }
   }
